pand the search scope."},filteredAppsTooltip:{id:"rovo.conversation-assistant.chat-prompt-input.filtered-apps.tooltip",defaultMessage:"Filtered sources mode",description:"Tooltip text displayed when hovering over the filtered apps pill/badge in the chat input area. Shown as a tooltip to provide additional context about filtered sources mode. The purpose is to help users understand that the conversation is limited to specific applications or data sources."},ghostIconsConnectAppsTooltip:{id:"rovo.conversation-assistant.chat-prompt-input.filtered-apps.ghost-icons-connect-apps-tooltip",defaultMessage:"Connect apps so Rovo can reference the work you do",description:"Tooltip text displayed when ghost app icons are shown in the filtered apps pill. It nudges users to connect third-party apps so Rovo can reference their work."},filteredAppsLabel:{id:"rovo.conversation-assistant.chat-prompt-input.filtered-apps.label",defaultMessage:"Sources:",description:"Label text displayed before the list of filtered application sources in the chat input area. Shown as a prefix label on the filtered apps pill/badge, followed by the names of the selected sources. The purpose is to introduce and identify the list of filtered data sources that are currently active in the conversation."},ghostIconsLabel:{id:"rovo.conversation-assistant.chat-prompt-input.filtered-apps.ghost-icons-label",defaultMessage:"Suggested apps to connect",description:"Accessibility label (aria-label) for the row of suggested third-party app icons shown next to the filtered sources in the chat input area. Read out by screen readers to describe the group of unconnected apps that the user is being nudged to connect."},newBadge:{id:"conversation-assistant-chat-prompt-input.chat-prompt-input.chat-mode-menu.filtered-apps.newBadge",defaultMessage:"New",description:"Promotional label shown in the sources pill when specific knowledge is enabled for a Rovo Space"},agentDisabledTooltip:{id:"rovo.conversation-assistant.chat-prompt-i