actions.jira-version-create.descriptionLabel",defaultMessage:"Description",description:"Text shown as the field label for the optional description input in the create release form within Rovo chat."},startDateLabel:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.jira-version-create.startDateLabel",defaultMessage:"Start Date",description:"Text shown as the field label for the start date picker in the create release form within Rovo chat."},releaseDateLabel:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.jira-version-create.releaseDateLabel",defaultMessage:"Release Date",description:"Text shown as the field label for the release date picker in the create release form within Rovo chat."},clearChooseDate:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.jira-version-create.clearChooseDate",defaultMessage:"Clear choose date",description:"Text shown as the accessible label for a button inside the date picker in the create release form that removes any currently selected date."},openCalendar:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.jira-version-create.openCalendar",defaultMessage:"Open calendar",description:"Text shown as the accessible label for a button inside the date picker in the create release form that opens the calendar overlay for date selection."},createVersionHeading:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.jira-version-create.createVersionHeading",defaultMessage:"Create release",description:"Text shown as the heading at the top of the create release action card in Rovo chat."},dateValidationError:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.jira-version-create.dateValidationError",defaultMessage:"The start date cannot be after the release date.",description:"Text shown as an inline validation error below the date fields in the create release form when the user enters a start date that falls after the release date."},nameValidationError:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.jira-version-create.nameValidationError",defaultMessage:"Enter a name.",description:"Text shown as an inline validation error below the name field in the create release form when the user submits t