-onboarding-prompts.heading",defaultMessage:"What do you want to use Rovo for today?",description:"Intro header message for Rovo Chat Onboarding Prompts flow."},descriptionForPrompts:{id:"rovo-chat.rovo-onboarding-prompts.description",defaultMessage:"Pick one to personalize your experience. You can always explore more later.",description:"Intro description message for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."}}),hG=(0,tX.defineMessages)({createNewIssuesQuicklyStub:{id:"rovo-chat.creator-prompts.create-new-issues-quickly",defaultMessage:"Create new issues quickly",description:"Prompt for creating a new issue quickly for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."},breakDownComplexIssuesStub:{id:"rovo-chat.creator-prompts.break-down-complex-issues",defaultMessage:"Break down complex issues",description:"Prompt for breaking down complex issues for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."},makeMyIssuesClearerStub:{id:"rovo-chat.creator-prompts.make-my-issues-clearer",defaultMessage:"Make my issues clearer",description:"Prompt for making my issues clearer for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."}}),hJ=(0,tX.defineMessages)({catchupAfterTimeAwayStub:{id:"rovo-chat.consumer-prompts.catchup-after-time-away",defaultMessage:"Catch up after time away",description:"Prompt for catching up after time away for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."},draftHelpfulCommentsOrUpdatesStub:{id:"rovo-chat.consumer-prompts.draft-helpful-comments-or-updates",defaultMessage:"Draft helpful comments or updates",description:"Prompt for drafting helpful comments or updates for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."},shareMyWorkWithStakeholdersStub:{id:"rovo-chat.consumer-prompts.share-my-work-with-stakeholders",defaultMessage:"Share my work with stakeholders",description:"Prompt for sharing my work with stakeholders for Rovo Chat Onboarding flow."}}),hZ=(0,tX.defineMessages)({createNewIssuesQuicklyPrompt:{id:"rovo-chat.creator-prompts.create-new-issues-quickly-prompt",defaultMessage:"Suggest a few concrete issues or subtasks my team might be missing. Start with a brie