Here's the comment I suggest adding to the page {name}. Take a look over it, then publish when you're ready.",description:'Message text displayed in an action card within the AI conversation interface when the AI suggests adding a comment to a Confluence page. Shown as the main message text in the action card body. The name placeholder will be substituted with the target Confluence page name (e.g., "Project Planning"). The <bold> tags will be rendered as bold text for "Publish". The purpose is to present the AI-generated comment content to the user for review and provide clear instructions on how to proceed with publishing the comment.'},pageSelectorLabel:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.confluence-comment-create.page-selector-label",defaultMessage:"Page",description:"Label text displayed above or next to a page selector dropdown in the Confluence comment creation action card within the AI conversation interface. Shown as a form field label. The purpose is to identify the page selector control, which allows users to choose which Confluence page the comment will be added to."},replyingAsLabel:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.confluence-comment-create.replying-as-label",defaultMessage:"Replying as",description:"Label text displayed above the replying with Agent info section in the Confluence comment creation action card within the AI conversation interface. Shown as a form field label."},replyWithAgentText:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.confluence-comment-create.reply-with-agent",defaultMessage:"{userName} with you",description:"Text displayed in the replying as section of the Confluence comment creation action card within the AI conversation interface. Shown beside overlapping avatars to indicate the agent/person replying together with the current user."},commentMessageLabel:{id:"ai-mate.message-actions.confluence-comment-create.comment-message-label",defaultMessage:"Message",description:"Label text displayed above the comment text box in the Confluence comment creation action