on has no name of its own."},buildButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.build-button-label",defaultMessage:"Build automation",description:"Label for the primary button at the bottom of the automation plan card. Pressing it creates the automation described in the card."},buildFlowButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.build-flow-button-label",defaultMessage:"Build flow",description:'Label for the primary button at the bottom of the automation plan card, shown before the flow has been created. Pressing it creates the flow without leaving the chat. "flow" is the Studio term for an automation and must be used in place of "rule".'},buildFlowInStudioButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.build-flow-in-studio-button-label",defaultMessage:"Build flow in Studio",description:'Label for the primary button at the bottom of the automation plan card when the card is shown outside Atlassian Studio, for example in Jira. Pressing it takes the user into Studio to build the automation there. "Studio" is the Atlassian Studio product name and must not be translated; "flow" is the Studio term for an automation.'},opensNewWindowLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.opens-new-window-label",defaultMessage:"Build flow in Studio<hidden>(opens in a new window)</hidden>",description:'Accessible label for the build button when pressing it opens Atlassian Studio in a new browser tab/window. The visible text is "Build flow in Studio"; "Studio" is the Atlassian Studio product name and must not be translated, and "flow" is the Studio term for an automation. The text wrapped in <hidden> is announced to screen reader users only and is not shown on screen.'},buildingButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.building-button-label",defaultMessage:"Building...",description:"Label shown on the primary button at the bottom of the automation plan card while the automation is being created. Replaces the normal button label during the in-progress state; the trailing ellipsis signals that work is ongoing."},buildAutomationErrorTitle:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.build-automation-error-title",defaultMessage:"Failed to create automation",description:"Title of the error notification (flag) shown when creating the automation from the plan card fails."},buildAutomationErrorDescription:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.build-automation-error-description",defaultMessage:"Something went wrong while creating the automation. Please try again.",description:"Body text of the error notification (flag) shown when creating the automation from the plan card fails. Tells the user the action did not complete and asks them to retry."},enableButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.enable-button-label",defaultMessage:"Enable flow",description:'Label for the primary button at the bottom of the automation plan card once the flow has been created. The flow is created switched off; pressing this button turns it on. "flow" is the Studio term for an automation and must be used in place of "rule".'},enablingButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.enabling-button-label",defaultMessage:"Enabling...",description:"Label shown on the primary button at the bottom of the automation plan card while the flow is being turned on. Replaces the normal button label during the in-progress state; the trailing ellipsis signals that work is ongoing."},enableRetryButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.enable-retry-button-label",defaultMessage:"Try again",description:"Label for the primary button at the bottom of the automation plan card after turning the flow on has failed. Pressing it retries enabling the flow."},editInStudioButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.edit-in-studio-button-label",defaultMessage:"Edit in Studio",description:'Label for the secondary button at the bottom of the automation plan card once the flow has been created. Pressing it opens the flow in the Atlassian Studio flow builder. "Studio" is the Atlassian Studio product name and must not be translated.'},viewInStudioButtonLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.view-in-studio-button-label",defaultMessage:"View in Studio",description:'Label for the button at the bottom of the automation plan card, shown when the flow was created by an earlier conversation but the card can no longer identify which flow it was. Pressing it opens Atlassian Studio, where the user can find the flow. "Studio" is the Atlassian Studio product name and must not be translated.'},flowEnabledLabel:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.flow-enabled-label",defaultMessage:"Flow enabled",description:'Confirmation text shown in place of the primary button at the bottom of the automation plan card once the flow has been turned on and is live. "flow" is the Studio term for an automation and must be used in place of "rule".'},enableErrorTitle:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.enable-error-title",defaultMessage:"Failed to enable flow",description:"Title of the error notification (flag) shown when turning the newly created flow on from the plan card fails."},enableErrorDescription:{id:"conversation-assistant-message-actions.studio-automation-create-flow.enable-error-description",defaultMessage:"Something went wrong while enabling the flow. Try again, or open it in Studio to check it.",description:'Body text of the error notification (flag) shown when turning the newly created flow on from the plan card fails. Tells the user the flow was still