preview-button",defaultMessage:"Preview",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface that opens a preview of the content. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it opens a preview modal or panel showing the content (such as a Confluence page, Jira issue, or document) that the AI is referencing. The purpose is to allow users to quickly view the content without leaving the conversation."},publishButton:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.publish-button",defaultMessage:"Publish",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface that saves the drafted content to Confluence. Shown as the text on a button alongside the Preview button. When clicked, it prompts the user to choose a Confluence space and parent page, then publishes the content the AI drafted. The purpose is to let users save the draft without first opening the full preview."},addButton:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.add-button",defaultMessage:"Add",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface that saves the drafted content to Confluence. Shown as the text on a button alongside the Preview button. This is an alternative wording of the Publish button being trialled to see which label users understand better. When clicked, it prompts the user to choose a Confluence space and parent page, then publishes the content the AI drafted."},openButton:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.open-button",defaultMessage:"Open",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface that opens the full content in its native application. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it opens the content (such as a Confluence page or Jira issue) in its full application view in a new tab or window. The purpose is to provide users with access to the full content in its native interface."},createDashboard:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.create-home-dashboard",defaultMessage:"Create Dashboard",description:"Title text displayed in the header of the dashboard preview card within the AI conversation interface. Shown as the heading of the preview card when the AI creates a Home dashboard. The purpose is to inform users that a new Home dashboard is being created."},viewingNow:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.viewing-now",defaultMessage:"Viewing now",description:"Label text displayed in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface, indicating that the user is currently viewing this content. Shown as a status label or badge on the preview card. The purpose is to inform users that this content is the one they are currently viewing, helping them understand the context of the AI's response."},newPreviewButton:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.new-preview-button",defaultMessage:"Open preview",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface that opens a preview of the content. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it opens a preview modal or panel showing the content that the AI is referencing. The purpose is to allow users to quickly view the content without leaving the conversation."},dynamicUiPreviewTitle:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.dynamic-ui-preview-title",defaultMessage:"Dynamic preview",description:"Accessibility title for the iframe displayed in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface, shown when a dynamic UI preview is rendered. Used as the title attribute on the iframe element for screen readers."},dynamicUiExpandButton:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.dynamic-ui-expand-button",defaultMessage:"Expand",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface that expands a preview of the content. Shown as the text on a button. When clicked, it opens a preview modal or panel showing the dynamic UI content that the AI is referencing. The purpose is to allow users to quickly view the content without leaving the conversation."},dynamicUiCopyButton:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.dynamic-ui-copy-button",defaultMessage:"Copy",description:"Button label displayed on a button in the conversation assistant preview card within the AI conversation interface that copies a link to the content. Shown as the text on a button. The purpose is to allow users to quickly copy the link to the content without leaving the conversation."},dynamicUiCopied:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.dynamic-ui-copied",defaultMessage:"Copied!",description:"Feedback shown after clicking the Copy button on the Maui app card in Rovo chat."},atlassianGuard:{id:"conversation-assistant-ui-components.atlassian-guard",defaultMessage:"Atlassian Guard",description:"Atlassian Guard brand label displayed in the footer of a generated policy preview card in Rovo chat."}}),x2=n(102978),x9=n(497807),x3=n(519705),x6=function(){return ne.createElement("svg",{xmlns:"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg",width:"16",height:"16",viewBox:"0 0 16 16",fill:"none"},ne.createElement("path",{d:"M0 4C0 1.79086 1.79086 0 4 0H12C14.2091 0 16 1.79086 16 4V12C16 14.2091 14.2091 16 12 16H4C1.79086 16 0 14.2091 0 12V4Z",fill:"#1868DB"}),ne.createElement("path",{d:"M11.9252 9.64097C9.23277 8.33909 8.44622 8.14455 7.31176 8.14455C5.98067 8.14455 4.84622 8.69823 3.83277 10.2545L3.66639 10.5089C3.53025 10.7184 3.5 10.7932 3.5 10.883C3.5 10.9728 3.54538 11.0476 3.71176 11.1523L5.42101 12.2148C5.51176 12.2747 5.58739 12.3046 5.66303 12.3046C5.75378 12.3046 5.81429 12.2597 5.90504 12.125L6.17731 11.706C6.60084 11.0626 6.97899 10.8531 7.46303 10.8531C7.88655 10.8531 8.38571 10.9728 9.00588 11.2721L10.7908 12.1101C10.972